IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `recjra-savings`

-- Reciprocal Enforcement of Commonwealth Judgments (Repeal) Act 2019, ss 1-5 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_reciprocal-enforcement-of-commonwealth-judgments-repeal-act-2019.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`an English judgment from before the appointed date, never registered` MEANS Judgment WITH
    `court` IS `a superior court of the United Kingdom`
    `was obtained before the appointed date` IS TRUE
    `the court is specified in a s 5 notification in force immediately before the appointed date` IS FALSE
    `was registered under s 3(1) and (2) of the repealed Act` IS FALSE
    `the registration was made before the appointed date` IS FALSE
    `is registrable under the repealed Act` IS TRUE

`an English judgment registered before the appointed date` MEANS Judgment WITH
    `court` IS `a superior court of the United Kingdom`
    `was obtained before the appointed date` IS TRUE
    `the court is specified in a s 5 notification in force immediately before the appointed date` IS FALSE
    `was registered under s 3(1) and (2) of the repealed Act` IS TRUE
    `the registration was made before the appointed date` IS TRUE
    `is registrable under the repealed Act` IS TRUE

