`a judgment of a court outside the Commonwealth` MEANS Judgment WITH
    `court` IS `a court of a country outside the Commonwealth`
    `was obtained before the appointed date` IS TRUE
    `the court is specified in a s 5 notification in force immediately before the appointed date` IS TRUE
