`an ungazetted Commonwealth judgment registered after the appointed date` MEANS Judgment WITH
    `court` IS `a court of another part of the Commonwealth`
    `was obtained before the appointed date` IS TRUE
    `the court is specified in a s 5 notification in force immediately before the appointed date` IS FALSE
    `was registered under s 3(1) and (2) of the repealed Act` IS TRUE
    `the registration was made before the appointed date` IS FALSE
    `is registrable under the repealed Act` IS FALSE

`an order for a Commonwealth country in force on the eve of the appointed date` MEANS Order WITH
    `was made under s 3 of the REFJA before the appointed date` IS TRUE
    `extends Part I of the REFJA to a part of the Commonwealth to which the repealed Act applied` IS TRUE
    `was in force immediately before the appointed date` IS TRUE

`an order made after the appointed date` MEANS Order WITH
    `was made under s 3 of the REFJA before the appointed date` IS FALSE
    `extends Part I of the REFJA to a part of the Commonwealth to which the repealed Act applied` IS TRUE
    `was in force immediately before the appointed date` IS FALSE

`an order revoked before the appointed date` MEANS Order WITH
    `was made under s 3 of the REFJA before the appointed date` IS TRUE
    `extends Part I of the REFJA to a part of the Commonwealth to which the repealed Act applied` IS TRUE
    `was in force immediately before the appointed date` IS FALSE

`an order for a country the repealed Act never applied to` MEANS Order WITH
    `was made under s 3 of the REFJA before the appointed date` IS TRUE
    `extends Part I of the REFJA to a part of the Commonwealth to which the repealed Act applied` IS FALSE
    `was in force immediately before the appointed date` IS TRUE

`an older foreign award registrable under the repealed Act` MEANS Award WITH
    `is a foreign award within the meaning of the International Arbitration Act` IS TRUE
    `was made before the appointed date` IS TRUE
    `is registrable under the repealed Act, including by the application of s 2(2)` IS TRUE

`a foreign award made after the appointed date` MEANS Award WITH
    `is a foreign award within the meaning of the International Arbitration Act` IS TRUE
    `was made before the appointed date` IS FALSE
    `is registrable under the repealed Act, including by the application of s 2(2)` IS TRUE

`an older foreign award not registrable under the repealed Act` MEANS Award WITH
    `is a foreign award within the meaning of the International Arbitration Act` IS TRUE
    `was made before the appointed date` IS TRUE
    `is registrable under the repealed Act, including by the application of s 2(2)` IS FALSE

`an older award that is not a foreign award` MEANS Award WITH
    `is a foreign award within the meaning of the International Arbitration Act` IS FALSE
    `was made before the appointed date` IS TRUE
    `is registrable under the repealed Act, including by the application of s 2(2)` IS TRUE

